doHistorico/aut/FDHA20130004174"/></skos:Concept><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://hispana.mcu.es/lod/oai:fondohistorico.cortesaragon.es:77#ent5"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="es">España-Mapas generales-1692</skos:prefLabel><skos:broader rdf:resource="https://hispana.mcu.es/lod/oai:fondohistorico.cortesaragon.es:77#ent8"/><skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="https://www.cortesaragon.es/fondoHistorico/aut/FDHA20140001996"/></skos:Concept><ore:Aggregation rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/571/https___hispana_mcu_es_lod_oai_fondohistorico_cortesaragon_es_77_ent0"><edm:aggregatedCHO rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/571/https___hispana_mcu_es_lod_oai_fondohistorico_cortesaragon_es_77_ent0"/><edm:dataProvider rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/organization/1482250000004503496"></edm:dataProvider><edm:isShownAt rdf:resource="https://www.cortesaragon.es/fondoHistorico/es/consulta/registro.do?id=77"/><edm:isShownBy rdf:resource="https://www.cortesaragon.es/fondoHistorico/i18n/catalogo_imagenes/imagen_id.do?idImagen=33184"/><edm:object rdf:resource="https://www.cortesaragon.es/fondoHistorico/i18n/catalogo_imagenes/imagen_id.do?idImagen=33184"/><edm:provider rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/organization/1482250000004671126"></edm:provider><edm:rights rdf:resource="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/"/></ore:Aggregation><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/europeana/571/https___hispana_mcu_es_lod_oai_fondohistorico_cortesaragon_es_77_ent0"><dc:date rdf:resource="#1692"></dc:date><dc:date rdf:resource="#1692"></dc:date><dc:date xml:lang="zxx">1692</dc:date><dc:description xml:lang="en">In the upper margin: "L “Espagne distinguièe en tous ses Royaumes, Principautes &amp; sçavoir sous la domination du Roy Catholique les roymes. de Castille, Leon, Gallice, Navarre, Andalusie, Grenade, Murcie, Aragon, Valence, Maiorque, et les printes. des Asturies, Biscaye et Catalogne. Sous la dominatio. du Roy de Portugal. les Roymes. de Portugal et D” Algarve. Tirè de plusie</dc:description><dc:description xml:lang="en">Scale also expressed in common leagues of France, Spain and Germany and leagues one hour on the way</dc:description><dc:description xml:lang="en">Oriented with rose and lis. - Graduate margins. - Relief by profile mounts and shading. - Outstanding hydrographic network. - Abundant toponymy. - Colored the boundaries of the different kingdoms.- Administrative divisions differentiated by color lines. - Cities represented by sets of buildings according to their importance. - Shady coasts with a fine scratches</dc:description><dc:description xml:lang="en">Tit. at the top: L “Espagne distinguished in tous ses royaumes, principaute” s &amp; sçavoir sous la domination du roy catholique, les roymes de Castille, Leon, Gallice, Navarre, Andalousie, Grenade, Murcie, Aragon, Valence et Maiorque et les printes des Asturies, Biscaye et Catalogne. sous la dominatio du roy de Portugal, les roymes. de Portugal, et d 'Algarve. Memoirs Plusieurs Land</dc:description><dc:description xml:lang="en">Title poster in cornucopia with plant motifs and a horse.Cartela with the dedication to the dolphin of France, on plant cornucopia with cherubim and fantastic fish at the base and crowned by shield. Cartela with scales decorated with philacterias</dc:description><dc:identifier>https://hispana.mcu.es/lod/oai:fondohistorico.cortesaragon.es:77#ent0</dc:identifier><dc:publisher xml:lang="fr">chez H. Iaillot, joignant les grands Augustins, aux des Globes ...</dc:publisher><dc:language>fra</dc:language><dc:rights xml:lang="en">The dissemination of descriptive information and digital images of this document has been authorized by the Cortes de Aragón exclusively for private use and for teaching and research activities. In no case is authorized its reproduction with lucrative purpose nor its distribution, public communication and transformation by any means without express and written authorization of the Cortes de Aragón. - http://creativecommons.org/-/by-nc-nd/4.0 /</dc:rights><dc:subject xml:lang="en">Spain-General Maps - 1692</dc:subject><dc:subject xml:lang="en">Portugal-General Maps - 1692</dc:subject><dc:type xml:lang="en">Maps</dc:type><dcterms:isPartOf xml:lang="en">In: Sanson, Nicolas. Nouvelle Introduction to the Géographie pour L 'usage de Monseigneur le Dauphin. - (93)</dcterms:isPartOf><dcterms:isReferencedBy xml:lang="en">References: Pastoureau, 91</dcterms:isReferencedBy><dcterms:issued rdf:resource="#1692"></dcterms:issued><dcterms:issued rdf:resource="#1692"></dcterms:issued><dcterms:issued xml:lang="zxx">1692</dcterms:issued><dcterms:spatial xml:lang="en">Spain-General Maps - 1692</dcterms:spatial><dcterms:spatial xml:lang="en">Portugal-General Maps - 1692</dcterms:spatial><dcterms:temporal rdf:resource="#1692"></dcterms:temporal><dcterms:temporal rdf:resource="#1692"></dcterms:temporal><dcterms:temporal rdf:resource="#1692"></dcterms:temporal><dcterms:temporal rdf:resource="#1692"></dcterms:temporal><dcterms:temporal xml:lang="en">1692</dcterms:temporal><edm:currentLocation xml:lang="en">Cortes Aragón Library</edm:currentLocation><edm:europeanaProxy>true</edm:europeanaProxy><edm:year>1692</edm:year><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/571/https___hispana_mcu_es_lod_oai_fondohistorico_cortesaragon_es_77_ent0"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/571/https___hispana_mcu_es_lod_oai_fondohistorico_cortesaragon_es_77_ent0"/><ore:lineage rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/provider/571/https___hispana_mcu_es_lod_oai_fondohistorico_cortesaragon_es_77_ent0"/><edm:type>IMAGE</edm:type></ore:Proxy><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/provider/571/https___hispana_mcu_es_lod_oai_fondohistorico_cortesaragon_es_77_ent0"><dc:contributor rdf:resource="https://hispana.mcu.es/lod/oai:fondohistorico.cortesaragon.es:77#ent3"></dc:contributor><dc:creator rdf:resource="https://hispana.mcu.es/lod/oai:fondohistorico.cortesaragon.es:77#ent4"></dc:creator><dc:date>1692</dc:date><dc:description xml:lang="es">En el margen superior: "L'Espagne distinguèe en tous ses Royaumes, Principautes &amp; sçavoir sous la domination du Roy Catholique les roymes. de Castille, Leon, Gallice, Navarre, Andalusie, Grenade, Murcie, Aragon, Valence, Maiorque, et les printes. des Asturies, Biscaye et Catalogne. Sous la dominatio. du Roy de Portugal. les Roymes. de Portugal et D'Algarve. Tirè de plusieurs Memoires"</dc:description><dc:description xml:lang="es">Escala también expresada en leguas comunes de Francia, España y Alemania y leguas de una hora de camino</dc:description><dc:description xml:lang="es">Copia digital : Fondo Documental Histórico (Cortes de Aragón)</dc:description><dc:description xml:lang="es">Orientado con rosa y lis. - Márgenes graduados. - Relieve por montes de perfil y sombreado. - Red hidrográfica destacada. - Abundante toponimia. - Coloreados los límites de los distintos reinos.- Divisiones administrativas diferenciadas por líneas de color. - Ciudades representadas por conjuntos de edificaciones según su importancia. - Costas sombreadas con un fino rayado</dc:description><dc:description xml:lang="es">Tít. en la parte superior: L'Espagne distingueé en tous ses royaumes, principaute's &amp; sçavoir sous la domination du roy catholique, les roymes de Castille, Leon, Gallice, Navarre, Andalousie, Grenade, Murcie, Aragon, Valence et Maiorque et les printes des Asturies, Biscaye et Catalogne. sous la dominatio du roy de Portugal, les roymes. de Portugal, et d'Algarve. Tieré de plusieurs Memoires</dc:description><dc:description xml:lang="es">Cartela del título en cornucopia con motivos vegetales y un caballo.- Cartela con la dedicatoria al delfín de Francia, sobre cornucopia vegetal con querubines y peces fantásticos en la base y coronada por escudo. Cartela con escalas decorada con filacterias</dc:description><dc:format xml:lang="en">image/jpeg</dc:format><dc:ident